PLAYING AND CONFIGURATION

You may download, install, and play with my mods. You may keep personal backup
copies and edit configuration files for your own setup.

You may share configuration files you edited and original presets you made,
including through a modpack or collection. These files must not contain my
code, scripts, plugins, assets, or other mod files. Credit my mod and link to
its official download when sharing files made for it. Original presets and
configuration files may earn Nexus Mods Donation Points; paid distribution
and other third-party monetisation require my prior written permission.

Public modpacks and collections may include unmodified official releases of
my mods. You do not need separate permission for that inclusion. Credit me as
Dnydd (formerly known as dklyntly), link the official mod page, and include
this license and the original notices with the mod files.

This permission covers distributing my unmodified mod as part of the pack,
including a pack download that contains those files. It does not allow a
standalone mirror, a renamed copy presented as another mod, or a modified
release. Paid redistribution of my files requires my prior written permission.
Collections may also use supported tools to download from the official page.
Only configuration files may be edited under this permission, except for the
contribution process and separately approved changes described below.

PRIVATE CODE CHANGES

Configuration edits are allowed as stated above. Private changes to source
