WHAT COUNTS AS WRITTEN APPROVAL

Written approval means an explicit message from me by email at
darklystudios@outlook.com, or from an account identified as mine on my official
mod page or repository. This can include a direct message or public reply
that clearly approves the requested use.

The message must identify the work and what I allow, including publication
when requested. Keep a copy. Silence, a reaction, a third-party statement, or
a message from an unverified account does not count as approval. Permission
to edit alone does not authorize distribution.

