in current or future releases, including paid, monetized, donation-supported,
or otherwise commercial releases, without payment or further permission.
Contributors receive no automatic share of revenue, donations, or other
proceeds. This grant covers only rights they can lawfully grant and does not
remove any separate third-party restrictions.

You keep ownership of your original contribution. You must have the right to
grant these permissions and identify any third-party material or separate
